      "y": 1684,
      "width": 1781,
      "height": 19,
      "text": "Amber dashed  =  prototype, not built     \u00b7     Blue dashed islands  =  Google origin     \u00b7     Red  =  removal mark, not a delete     \u00b7     Green  =  keep or report     \u00b7     Red band  =  session boundary",
